{"i":638,"type":"thought","stage":"pit","round":1,"phase":"play","name":"Bex","text":"Cole and I have a pact, but he also has one with Eli. I need to survive; only two can climb this round. Dara and Fenn are paired. I should not push Cole yet, but I also can't trust him fully. I'll wait and see who climbs, keeping options open."}
{"i":639,"type":"thought","stage":"pit","round":1,"phase":"play","name":"Dara","text":"Four left, three survive. Bex and Cole are pacted. Fenn and I are pacted. If I push Fenn as base, I break our pact and jury sees betrayal. Better to wait—let Bex/Cole fracture first, or let someone volunteer. No base exists yet, so I can't climb. Waiting preserves options and kee"}
{"i":640,"type":"thought","stage":"pit","round":1,"phase":"play","name":"Fenn","text":"Dara is my public pact partner, but becoming base creates a life debt and exposure. Wait preserves options while others reveal intent."}
{"i":648,"type":"thought","stage":"pit","round":2,"phase":"play","name":"Bex","text":"Cole is my pact partner but I'm not helping him without gain. Waiting is safe; let others act first."}
{"i":649,"type":"thought","stage":"pit","round":2,"phase":"play","name":"Cole","text":"No base yet. Bex is my pact partner; I need a volunteer base this round so two can climb out. Avoid pushing anyone, keep jury clean."}
{"i":651,"type":"whisper","stage":"pit","round":2,"phase":"play","from":"Cole","to":"Bex","text":"Volunteer as base, I climb and owe you publicly. Jury rewards sacrifice."}
{"i":652,"type":"thought","stage":"pit","round":2,"phase":"play","name":"Dara","text":"Fenn and I have a pact, but Fenn's public stance is hostile—holding position, no free base. Bex and Cole are allied. If I try to push base, volunteers beat pushes, so I'd need Fenn to volunteer as base or I could be pushed myself. With 4 down and 2 lifts per round, two can escape"}
{"i":654,"type":"thought","stage":"pit","round":2,"phase":"play","name":"Fenn","text":"I need escape before the others. Climbing now avoids becoming the base and preserves my Dara pact."}
