{"i":680,"type":"thought","stage":"pit","round":4,"phase":"play","name":"Cole","text":"Flood is 3 of 5 rounds in; leaving now secures me. Bex and Dara can both climb with two lifts available. A rescue would trap me anchoring under a rising flood. Leave."}
{"i":682,"type":"whisper","stage":"pit","round":4,"phase":"play","from":"Cole","to":"Bex","text":"Climb this round; two slots, Dara takes the other. I keep our pact."}
